{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/2f6e6a05f95023598109143d3250363d.avif?t=1757320559\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.poster.avif?t=1757320559\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.webm?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.mp4?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's Breaking Out</strong> is a card game with dice and ancient mysteries, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A macabre and immersive plot inspired by H. P. Lovecraft\u2019s work;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dice instead of mana, meaning you\u2019re playing with chance as you try and conquer the chaos;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tons of different builds and possible strategies each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/d96a9db33485996b8e65959a343fbe29.avif?t=1757320559\" data-has-big width=800 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/08036b743491574b227a71752ff58e4e.poster.avif?t=1757320559\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/08036b743491574b227a71752ff58e4e.webm?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/08036b743491574b227a71752ff58e4e.mp4?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice are king in this game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice to activate cards and cast spells - cross your fingers and pray that luck is on your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/5d88e659dc0328a2e3d2851259ab954c.avif?t=1757320559\" data-has-big width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/b8c7cda898b2f58693e49539589fbead.poster.avif?t=1757320559\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/b8c7cda898b2f58693e49539589fbead.webm?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/b8c7cda898b2f58693e49539589fbead.mp4?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inside is one who craves freedom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within forgotten ruins, our heroes stumble upon an ancient box that is covered in mysterious symbols. Wrapped in chains that seem to restrain it, warning signs seek to protect the world from the being that lurks inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors and stories of the box abound, but surely these are nothing more than fairy tales told to children, right? It seems though that the truth is far older and more terrifying than any story\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3095820?t=1757320559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/911ac23ce50de35d3b33ba6c427b2f83fb9742aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757320559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/d4fcd41f630968683b313613955e1eb5b8eaf100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757320559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/d4fcd41f630968683b313613955e1eb5b8eaf100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757320559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/2f6e6a05f95023598109143d3250363d.avif?t=1757320559\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.poster.avif?t=1757320559\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.webm?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3095820/extras/52a65d1af917c2aaacfd9ee4767b6527.mp4?t=1757320559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's Breaking Out</strong> is a card game with dice and ancient mysteries, featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A macabre and immersive plot inspired by H. P. Lovecraft\u2019s work;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dice instead of mana, meaning you\u2019re 